      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The fix they did was not going to stop vram from climbing it would just help stop the issue of going in and out of the overlay causing the usage increase due to that resolution change. I dont know if they did anything else but until they can get the Unity engine to actually clear vram properly it will continue to climb until you relaunch the game.",
